1
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:05,800
P'Dan.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,360
Let's break up.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,680
I knew

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,280
that you didn't like me.

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,840
Thank you so much.

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,200
Can we talk for a minute?

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,560
I want to know everything you do.

8
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,560
Jane. Hey.

9
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:17,720
Hey.

10
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:18,800
Hey!

11
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,480
I'll cover you.

12
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,800
If I don't make it back within ten minutes,

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,680
just drive away.

14
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:23,960
P'Jane!

15
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,080
Jane's always dragging people

16
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,640
into things like this.

17
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,880
If you're worried about him,

18
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,640
please help talk some sense into him.

19
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,800
He probably won't listen to me.

20
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,760
I don't think he'd listen to me either.

21
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,480
I wish you nothing but luck.

22
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,320
So, you're not going to quit, right?

23
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,160
If you choose this kind of life,

24
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,480
I wish you the best of luck then.

25
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,080
What are you doing?

26
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,440
Please go back and sit down first.

27
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:23,560
Jane, you can't just abandon me like this.

28
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,400
Have you forgotten?

29
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,200
That you owe me.

30
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,840
Please go back and sit down first.

31
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,080
We can talk later.

32
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,880
Go back and wait for me at the condo first.

33
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:41,960
I'll follow you there shortly.

34
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,920
Can you even make it back by yourself?

35
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,520
I'll have my driver pick me up.

36
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,280
Wait for me at the condo.

37
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,960
I'm never letting you go.

38
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:32,560
You walk in with a warning sign

39
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:40,040
Just one look and already falling for you

40
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:47,160
My friends tell me not to cross that line

41
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,440
But I’m already out of time

42
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,480
I know the truth, I taste the sin

43
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,120
It’s wrong but I don’t want it to be true

44
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,640
I’m losing all my discipline

45
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:06,760
You’re all I’m thinking of

46
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,840
and I’m breaking all the rules

47
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,160
just because…

48
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:14,560
You’re a red flag but I’m colorblind

49
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,960
I know you’re dangerous

50
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:21,760
If it burns, let it burn me alive

51
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:26,079
I can't hold myself back, I’d cross every line

52
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:34,360
Ooh

53
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,000
Stay still.

54
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,840
I'll do it for you.

55
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,160
I can do it.

56
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,880
I've done it before.

57
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,840
You're being stubborn again.

58
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,400
That's enough.

59
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,480
Come here.

60
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,080
Thank you

61
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,120
for not leaving me.

62
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,440
Are you still worried about something?

63
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,720
Are you afraid that staying with me

64
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:56,040
will put you in danger?

65
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,840
Don't worry.

66
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:02,040
I won't let anyone lay a finger on you.

67
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,160
And if you're worried

68
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:05,960
about anything happening to me,

69
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,680
I don't die easily.

70
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:19,040
I can trust you, right?

71
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,520
If anything happens to you,

72
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,600
I don't think I can go on.

73
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,480
Ugh, I'm so damn sleepy.

74
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:10,280
Why the hell aren't there any night classes?

75
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,240
By the way, where the hell did Jane disappear to?

76
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,200
Hey,

77
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,200
aren't finals coming up soon?

78
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,400
I can't get ahold of him at all.

79
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,720
Yeah, actually, I haven't seen him either.

80
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,200
Is he sick or something?

81
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,120
I have no idea.

82
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,680
Do you know anything, Put?

83
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,560
Nope.

84
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,520
Shit.

85
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,320
Damn it.

86
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:30,920
I'm worried about him,

87
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,600
afraid he's gonna miss the exams.

88
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,920
Worry about yourself first, man.

89
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,840
Oh, I'll take the exams for sure.

90
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,960
But whether I'll pass is a different story.

91
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,080
Hello, Uncle.

92
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,040
Hi.

93
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:49,760
Hi there, are you looking for Jane?

94
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:50,880
Yes, sir.

95
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,600
Jane's not home.

96
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,720
Do you know where he went, Uncle?

97
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,720
I don't know, he didn't say.

98
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,600
But I saw him

99
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,280
