100
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,200
I see.

101
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,280
Thank you very much, see you around.

102
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,880
Alright, alright, bye.

103
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:33,520
Hmm?

104
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,400
I brewed some herbal medicine for you.

105
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,320
Thank you.

106
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,920
Drink it slowly, it's hot.

107
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,800
Where have you been?

108
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:55,840
Why aren't you resting?

109
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,920
Your stitches might rip open.

110
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,720
You promised me, right?

111
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,200
That you'd tell me everything.

112
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:11,760
It's just business

113
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,280
you know that.

114
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,920
Let me go change my clothes first.

115
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,320
Then I'm going to see my friends tonight.

116
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,799
Since you can still go off and do your business.

117
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,200
Hello?

118
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,800
What are you up to?

119
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,200
Nothing much.

120
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,560
Are you free tonight?

121
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,800
I'm kinda stressed out.

122
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,200
You wanna get drunk?

123
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,880
I have some booze.

124
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,200
Sure.

125
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,400
I remember.

126
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,240
Back in freshman year

127
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,840
when we went to China together, right?

128
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,600
That day, my phone

129
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,480
counted like twenty thousand steps.

130
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,680
But on that day,

131
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,680
you and I went back to the hotel first.

132
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,600
But do you remember?

133
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:54,000
Gap walked nearly thirty thousand steps.

134
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,800
Really?

135
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:55,520
Like...

136
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,120
Oh.

137
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,720
Gap went shopping afterwards.

138
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,120
Or to be exact, the bastard

139
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,760
followed Cherry around to carry her shopping bags.

140
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,520
When he got back to the hotel,

141
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,400
he was like this

142
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,600
I can't take this anymore.

143
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,560
Gap, Gap.

144
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,360
It's okay.

145
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,800
For Cherry,

146
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,480
this is a piece of cake.

147
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,480
Hey,

148
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,880
honestly, I think Cherry can tell.

149
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,320
He's got a shot, though.

150
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,680
Going after her like that

151
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,600
If he still not her boyfriend by graduation,

152
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,000
he should just give up.

153
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,400
True.

154
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,280
But seriously, going to China back then was

155
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,480
so much fun.

156
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,480
On the day we had to return,

157
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,000
I didn't want to come back at all.

158
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,280
If we could travel like that forever,

159
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,400
that'd be nice, right?

160
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,360
Look at you,

161
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,880
getting all emotional again.

162
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:51,960
Shit,

163
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:53,320
calling me out.

164
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,080
But I like it,

165
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,880
you being like this.

166
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:13,840
Come on, cheers.

167
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,080
So,

168
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,120
what exactly happened

169
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,280
during the time you went missing?

170
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:31,520
I almost died.

171
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,760
What?

172
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:33,960
I...

173
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,360
almost got shot.

174
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,200
But I'm okay.

175
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,120
It's because of P'Jane, right?

176
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,560
Why

177
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:48,840
does he have to drag you into dangerous,

178
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,000
fucked-up shit like that?

179
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:52,080
It's not his fault.

180
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,440
I was the one who asked him to take me along.

181
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:58,880
You asked him?

182
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:01,960
Well, if I'm going to spend my life with him,

183
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:03,960
I want to know

184
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,600
what kind of life he lives.

185
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,200
Now that you know, how is it?

186
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,240
I don't think I can handle it.

187
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,800
He's driving me absolutely insane.

188
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,960
You can get out of there, you know.

189
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,440
Out of his life.

190
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,640
You're afraid

191
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:28,640
he'll come after you to take you back, right?

192
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,600
If there's anything I can do to help,

193
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:32,920
just tell us.

194
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,400
This time, I'll protect you myself.

195
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,440
I can't get out.

196
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,200
Yes, you can.

197
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,200
If we work together, there has to be a way.

198
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,400
You just don't understand.

199
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:49,720
I love him so much

200
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,480
that I can't bring myself to leave him.

201
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:55,040
But staying with him,

202
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:56,720
I'm also terrified

203
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:59,400
that one day I'll see something happen to him.

204
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,360
So, why did you come see me then?

205
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:14,360
I don't know.

206
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:20,000
I just couldn't keep this to myself anymore.

207
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,560
And you're

208
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,920
the only friend who knows everything.

209
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,480
Why?

210
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,160
Hey,

211
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,320
what the hell are you doing?

212
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,280
Even though whenever anyone

213
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,280
asks you for anything,

214
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,880
you do absolutely everything for them.

215
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,480
But when it comes to me,

216
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,520
I ask you for just one thing,

217
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,280
and you can't do it for me.

218
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,480
Put, calm down.

219
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,760
At least,

220
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,680
just this once.

221
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,040
Put, what's wrong with you?

222
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:04,000
Can you please just do what I ask for once?

223
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,160
Put, it hurts.

224
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,520
Let go!

225
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,760
Jane.

226
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,400
Let go!

227
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,600
You're wasted right now!

228
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,280
Hey!

229
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:21,160
What the hell is wrong with you, Put!

230
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:21,960
Jane.

231
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:22,920
Jane.

232
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:23,640
You piece of shit, Put.

233
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,120
Hey.

234
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,640
Jane.

235
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,440
Let go.

236
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:26,160
Jane.

237
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,600
Jane. Let go.

238
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,120
Jane.

239
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:28,600
Jane.

240
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,120
Let go!

241
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,320
Jane.

242
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:30,800
Jane.

243
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:31,680
Ow!

244
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,920
Jane, I'm sorry.

245
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,000
I think you should just stop.

246
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,200
I understand you.

247
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,080
It's my fault.

248
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,200
Shit.

249
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,920
I shouldn't have done that.

250
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:01,560
It's my fault.

251
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,440
It's all because of me.

252
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:06,960
It's because of me.

253
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,400
Forget it.

254
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:16,280
I'm leaving.

255
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:18,760
Jane.

256
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:28,400
Jane.

257
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,520
How did you get here?

258
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:07,600
Jane,

259
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,280
I'm really sorry about just now.

260
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:22,880
Argh!

261
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:23,480
Hey!

262
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,560
P'Jane!

263
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,880
It's not what you think!

264
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:27,720
P'Jane!

265
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:28,800
Stop!

266
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:39,200
P'Jane!

267
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:41,880
Enough!

268
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:43,680
If you don't stop,

269
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,880
I'm never going to see you again.

270
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,440
If you ever come near Jane again,

271
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,000
I won't let you off easy.

272
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,720
We shouldn't see each other for a while, Put.

273
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,240
