286
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:20,800
Jane...

287
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,400
Everything you think is good,

288
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,280
both the favor

289
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,400
and the tracking..

290
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,320
Have you ever even tried to

291
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:26,360
