631
00:55:40,200 --> 00:55:41,440
even though it was painful.

632
00:55:41,840 --> 00:55:44,680
In the past, I dragged you into my life,

633
00:55:45,280 --> 00:55:48,280
but I never tried to step into yours.

634
00:55:48,960 --> 00:55:51,240
So I fully intended to try and learn,

635
00:55:51,680 --> 00:55:53,480
and I was determined to do it.

636
00:55:54,600 --> 00:55:56,120
But I guess I started too late.

637
00:56:16,160 --> 00:56:17,760
Last reason,

638
00:56:17,760 --> 00:56:20,080
I once told you that the rule of being together

639
00:56:20,080 --> 00:56:22,480
