642
00:56:26,880 --> 00:56:29,680
I just wanted to see you become a bit stronger.

643
00:56:30,120 --> 00:56:32,600
You've never been selfish at all.

644
00:56:32,600 --> 00:56:33,800
You always ask for everything

645
00:56:33,800 --> 00:56:35,040
